# Environment variables for the ai-memory project
# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in with real values.
#
# Loading: modern shells (zsh/bash) can source it automatically via direnv,
# or export manually before starting Claude Code / Codex / OpenCode:
#   set -a; . ./.env; set +a
#
# The agents (.mcp.json, opencode.json, .codex/config.toml) interpolate these vars
# at runtime — secrets NEVER go into git.

# --- ai-memory-svc MCP (lab) -----------------------------------------------
# JWT from the Keycloak `ai-memory-svc` realm to access the MCP via Traefik forwardAuth.
# Get it with:
#   ./scripts/get-mcp-jwt.sh
# The token expires in 15min (Keycloak default); for long sessions, export with refresh.
# Lab only — in prod, the JWT will come from the corporate Keycloak via SSO/PKCE.
WIKI_SERVICE_JWT=
